OL,3,GNEWSA'My husband showed no symptoms of
OL,4,Aprostate cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Karen Bowler's late husband was
OL,7,Ffirst diagnosed with prostate cancer,
OL,8,Fshe said he had initially shown no
OL,9,Fobvious symptoms.
OL,11,FPeter Bowler, from Stone,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, was diagnosed with the
OL,13,Fdisease in early 2018 and died in 2025,
OL,14,Fat the age of 66.
OL,16,F"Pete never had any symptoms of
OL,17,Fanything, he hadn't felt poorly," his
OL,18,Fwidow told BBC Radio Stoke.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
